### Register: başarılı (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ali Veli", "email": "Ali@Example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Register: aynı e-posta, farklı harf (409 EMAIL_TAKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Baska Biri", "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Register: kısa şifre (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ayse", "email": "ayse@example.com", "password": "123" }

### Register: fazladan alan yok sayılmalı (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mehmet", "email": "mehmet@example.com", "password": "gizli12345", "emailVerifiedAt": "2020-01-01" }